%% Imzo: one approval, end to end.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant I as Initiator (laptop)
  participant S as Approval service
  participant D as Imzo app (phone)
  actor P as Approver
  participant C as Core (mock)
  I->>S: POST /orders (items, approvers)
  S-->>I: order id + one request per approver device
  I->>D: request QR frames (no network)
  D->>D: strict parse, recompute total, fingerprint
  D->>P: show amount, items, fingerprint
  P->>D: confirm with biometric (or reject)
  D->>D: sign with Keystore key, counter + 1
  D->>I: answer QR frames (signed)
  I->>S: POST /answers
  S->>S: verify hash, signature, counter, expiry, maker-checker
  alt approved by every required approver
    S->>C: execute the stored order
    S-->>I: status executed
  else rejected, invalid or expired
    S-->>I: status not executed (audit event written)
  end
